<i>Fall in love like</i>
<i>you're waking up</i>

00:23:23.570 --> 00:23:28.950
<i>And then take</i>
<i>me into dreamland</i>

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:34.706
<i>You always, you always</i>

00:23:34.706 --> 00:23:44.883
<i>You always told me tender lies</i>

00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:57.354
<i>The 17th Platoon takes a brief vacation.</i>

00:23:57.354 --> 00:24:00.398
<i>However, their peaceful days will not last long.</i>

